WEBVTT

00:02:57.229 --> 00:03:00.255
that, for one blistering moment,

00:03:00.279 --> 00:03:02.841
forms the unmistakeable shape

00:03:02.865 --> 00:03:04.524
of a giant bird

00:03:04.548 --> 00:03:06.710
flapping against the sky.

00:03:07.351 --> 00:03:11.386
It is why your mouth forms an "o"

00:03:11.410 --> 00:03:12.884
that is not a gasp,

00:03:12.908 --> 00:03:15.468
but rather, the beginning of,

00:03:15.492 --> 00:03:18.299
"Oh. Of course."

00:03:18.323 --> 00:03:24.412
As in, of course the heart of a blue whale
is as large as a house

00:03:24.436 --> 00:03:28.772
with chambers tall enough
to fit a person standing.

00:03:28.796 --> 00:03:32.695
Of course a fig becomes possible